  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       DIY GRBL CAM — Vector icon set
       Monochrome, 24×24 design space, filled geometries authored so they
       render crisp and identical on every platform (no emoji / font glyphs).
       Use from AXAML via:
         <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource Icon.Xxx}"/>
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

